                <pb facs="0266" n="178" sameAs="frus:frus1892/pg178"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Certificate of naturalization of Charles E.
                        Heintzman</hi>.</head>
                <p rendition="#flush">1776.</p>
                <p rendition="#right">1812.</p>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">The United States of North
                        America</hi>.</p>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">certificate of
                        naturalization.</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">State of Michigan</hi>,<lb/><hi
                        rendition="#italic">Lenawee County, ss:</hi></p>
                <p>I, George W. Fleming, clerk of the circuit court for the county of Lenawee and
                    State of Michigan (the said court being a court of record, having common law
                    jurisdiction, and a clerk and seal), do hereby certify that Charles E. Heintzman
                    is a citizen of the United States of America, duly naturalized according to the
                    laws of said United States, to which citizenship he was admitted in open court,
                    held at the court-house in the city of Adrian, county and State aforesaid, on
                    Friday, the fourth day of October, in the year of our Lord one thousand eight
                    hundred and eighty-nine, as appears from the records of said circuit court now
                    in my office.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">In witness whereof, I have hereunto set my
                        hand and affixed the seal of said circuit court <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1889-10-04">the 4th day of October. A. D. 1889</date>.</dateline>
                    <lb/> [<hi rendition="#small-caps">seal.</hi>] <signed><hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">George W. Fleming</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">County Clerk.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
